1vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"30 July 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If you have searched for “kitchen installation near me cost”, you are probably trying to work out whether a quote is reasonable before committing to a fitter. The answer depends on much more than the size of the room. Your choice of units, worktops and appliances, the condition of the walls and floor, and whether plumbing or electrics need moving can all change the final figure. This guide explains the rough costs you may encounter in the UK, what a local kitchen fitter may include, and the questions to ask when comparing quotes in Watford, Hertfordshire, North London or Bedfordshire."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How much does kitchen installation cost in the UK?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["As a rough typical UK guide, installation-only labour for a straightforward kitchen may be around £2,000 to £5,000, although smaller jobs may cost less and complex installations may cost considerably more. This may assume that the kitchen has already been designed and supplied, the room is in reasonable condition, and the existing layout is not changing substantially. The scope can include removing old units, installing cabinets and worktops, fitting appliances, and associated plumbing, electrical or finishing work, but this must be confirmed in writing. Every project differs, so get a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For a complete new kitchen, including units, worktops, appliances, installation and some preparation work, a broad typical UK working budget may be approximately £8,000 to £20,000 or more. A basic, compact kitchen with standard units and limited alterations may fall towards the lower end. A larger kitchen with bespoke cabinetry, stone worktops, premium appliances, structural changes or extensive rewiring may exceed this range. These are rough guide prices only: every project differs, and you should get a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What does a local kitchen fitter usually include?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The phrase “kitchen installation” is not used consistently by every contractor. One quote may include only cabinet assembly and fitting, while another may cover the whole project from removal through to final decoration. Before comparing prices, ask each fitter to state exactly what is included and what will be arranged by you or another trade."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal and disposal of the existing kitchen, including whether skip hire or waste charges are included."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Assembly, levelling and fixing of base units, wall units, tall units, panels, plinths and end pieces."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktop cutting and fitting, with separate pricing often applying to laminate, solid wood, quartz, granite or other specialist surfaces."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Sink, tap and appliance connections, subject to the required plumbing, electrical supply and manufacturer instructions."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plumbing alterations, such as moving a sink, dishwasher or washing machine, if this is part of the contractor’s scope."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Electrical work, including additional sockets, lighting or appliance connections where appropriate and agreed in advance."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Wall and floor preparation, tiling, flooring, decorating and making good, which may be included, priced separately or excluded."]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Final adjustments, silicone sealing and removal of protective materials once the installation is complete."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"The main factors that affect kitchen installation prices"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The number of cabinets is only one part of the calculation. Labour may increase when the room requires more trades, more detailed preparation or more time-consuming finishing work. A local team that handles several parts of the installation in-house can sometimes make coordination simpler, but you should still check the detailed scope rather than assuming that every trade is included."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Layout, access and preparation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Keeping the sink, cooker and dishwasher in their current positions can reduce plumbing and electrical alterations. Moving them may improve the design, but it can involve new pipework, cables, waste connections, floor repairs and wall making-good. Removing a wall, widening a doorway or altering a window can introduce structural work and may require separate professional advice. Uneven floors, damaged plaster, damp, old wiring or poor ventilation can also add preparation costs."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Materials, appliances and finish level"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Cabinet construction, door style and internal storage fittings can create significant differences in price. Standard laminate worktops are often less costly than solid timber, compact surfaces or natural stone, while bespoke sizes and complicated joints can increase fitting time. Integrated appliances, boiling-water taps, filtered-water systems, feature lighting and specialist extraction can all require additional installation work. If you are supplying your own appliances, check their dimensions and connection requirements before ordering the units."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"The condition and age of the property"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Older homes in and around Watford, Bushey, St Albans, Harrow, Luton and Bedford may have walls, floors, plumbing or electrics that need attention before a new kitchen can be fitted. This is not necessarily a problem, but it is a reason to allow a contingency rather than using every pound of the initial budget. A useful approach is to ask what the quotation assumes about the existing room and what would happen if concealed defects are discovered after removal."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to compare kitchen installation quotes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The cheapest quote is not automatically the best value, particularly if important tasks have been left out. Request itemised quotations from two or more suitable local installers and give each of them the same plans, product list and specification. If your project is in Watford, you can review the scope of a local service such as ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting in Watford"}],", but the same questions apply wherever you are based."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Check whether the price is for labour only, installation plus materials, or a complete supply-and-fit package."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Confirm whether VAT is included and whether the quote is fixed, estimated or subject to measured quantities."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Look for a clear list of included and excluded work, including demolition, waste disposal, flooring, tiling, decorating and appliance connections."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Ask who is responsible for supplying units, worktops, sinks, taps, appliances and finishing materials, and who checks that deliveries are complete and undamaged."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Confirm the expected start date, approximate duration, payment stages and how variations will be approved."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Ask how unexpected work is priced. Any change should be explained and agreed before the additional work is carried out."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Check that plumbing, tiling, electrical work and cabinet installation are covered by the named contractor or clearly allocated to other trades."]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Make sure the final quote reflects your actual room measurements and appliance models rather than being based only on an online design."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Choosing a kitchen installation team near you"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A nearby fitter may be easier to contact during a project, but location alone should not decide your choice. Look for a clear written scope, sensible answers about preparation and evidence that the contractor understands the type of kitchen you want. Ask whether the same team can coordinate cabinet fitting, plumbing, tiling, electrics and finishing work, or whether you will need to manage several separate appointments. BMB Renovation is based at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN, and offers kitchen fitting and renovation across Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Borehamwood, Harrow, Croxley Green, Luton and Bedford. All plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation work is handled in-house. You can review the wider ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/services","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"renovation services"}]," available before discussing your particular requirements."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Questions to ask before booking"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before accepting a quotation, ask for the proposed sequence of work and find out when the kitchen will be usable again. Confirm what you need to do before the start date, such as clearing cupboards, arranging appliance deliveries or protecting adjoining rooms. It is also sensible to ask how long the quote remains valid, whether design changes will affect the price, and how snagging or adjustments will be dealt with at the end. A written quotation should leave you with a realistic understanding of the total project cost, not just an attractive starting figure."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get My Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-help w-6 h-6 text-[#C8A97E]","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","1u773s",{"d":"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"}],["$","path","p32p05",{"d":"M12 17h.01"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/4